1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Our stories live in the things we carry.

2
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:22,500
Some are memories passed down through
our hands.

3
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Others are values passed from one
generation to another.

4
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:47,500
Even when we travel far, we never forget
our roots.

5
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:00,000
We carry the past so we can give
something to the future.

6
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:13,500
Because our stories continue through the
meaning we pass on.
